atforms still rely on tens of thousands of human contractors to clean up after their automated safety filters fail? Until policymakers force corporations to maintain named legal liability for every line of firmware deployed into children's products, decentralized build-pipeline checks remain a convenient fiction for corporations dodging accountability.",
